      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A one-room house once inhabited by Swedish immigrants now displays antiques and artifacts, showcasing early immigrant life.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.odebolt.net/attractions",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The historic bank building on Main Street, between 1st and 2nd Streets, houses a small history room with Adams banking and ranch stories.",
